{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Barbaric Rage: while enraged, Barbarian abilities have a 1.0 s global cooldown (#3945)",
  "contract": [
    "Barbaric Rage (804337) reads 'While enraged, the global cooldown of Barbarian abilities is reduced by 30%.',",
    "and every Enrage ability tooltip embeds it (@s:804337:0@). Its native effect is a FLAT -500 ms",
    "SPELLMOD_GLOBAL_COOLDOWN on Barbarian family masks with CasterAuraState ENRAGE, so enraged Barbarian",
    "abilities have a 1000 ms global cooldown (Spell::TriggerGlobalCooldown clamps to MIN_GCD 1000) and",
    "everything else keeps 1500 ms. The core applies a learned passive regardless of its CasterAuraState, so the",
    "modifier is zero unless the Barbarian is Enraged. The ability cooldown of Outrage (803499, 90 s) is not",
    "changed. Brutal Shout (300857: family 18 flags word 1 = 32, StartRecoveryCategory 133, StartRecoveryTime",
    "1500, instant, self-cast) is the measured ability; it is a magic, non-ability spell, so its global cooldown",
    "also scales with UNIT_MOD_CAST_SPEED, asserted 1.0 for both fresh level 80 fixtures. Unbridled Rage (801761,",
    "Dispel Enrage) sets the enrage state; removing it must restore 1500 ms. The control Barbarian without",
    "Barbaric Rage keeps 1500 ms while enraged. Barbaric Rage, Unbridled Rage and Brutal Shout are level 2/4",
    "automatic progression grants (CoA.AutoProgression, off by default) and Outrage must be trained, so all are",
    "learned explicitly; the control unlearns Barbaric Rage in case progression granted it. Readings are taken",
    "right after the instant cast; the windows allow 150 ms of world ticks and keep 1000 and 1500 apart."
  ],
  "timeout_ms": 90000,
